  "title": "Black Bean Soup with Carrots and Tomatoes",
  "blurb": "A warming soup with black beans, carrots and tomatoes in a light vegetable broth, finished with a dash of hot sauce.",
  "steps": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pot over medium heat and cook the chopped onion for 5 minutes until soft.",
    "Add the crushed garlic, sliced carrots and cumin, then stir for 1 minute.",
    "Tip in the black beans, tomatoes with their liquid, vegetable broth and bay leaves.",
    "Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat and simmer for 20 minutes until the carrots are tender.",
    "Remove the bay leaves and stir in the hot sauce and black pepper to taste."
